config SEN0193
	bool "DFRobot SEN0193 Capacitive Soil Moisture Sensor"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_DFROBOT_SEN0193_ENABLED
	depends on ADC
	help
	  Enable driver for the SEN0193 Capacitive Soil Moisture Sensor (v1.0.2).
	  This driver abstracts raw ADC reads into a calibrated 0-100% moisture value.
